  message: "DONE, merged in PR #179. Close condition met with its own negative controls.\n\nCLOSE CONDITION was: re-run INV-karud's realizability probe on the 9-repo\ncohort; every surviving non-realizable match must be explainable from the\nemitted record alone, without re-deriving the match.\n\nRESULT, cohort-joruv arm, 354 evidence rows:\n    EXACT         341   emitted module == catalog module\n    PACKAGE_TYPE   13   catalog extends emitted by a component\n                        (net/http -> net/http.Client)\n    PATH_SLOT       0\n    NO_CATALOG      0\n    UNEXPLAINED     0\n    explainable from the record alone: 354/354\n\nNEGATIVE CONTROLS, same probe, earlier arms — this is what makes 354/354 mean\nsomething rather than being a probe that cannot fail:\n    cohort-p1      (pre-fix)          0/354   all NO_CATALOG\n    cohort-after   (WI-damir era)     0/312   all NO_CATALOG, and `logging.go`\n                                              still visible in the module slot\n\nPURITY VERIFIED: flows vs the pre-fix arm are 0 added, 0 removed across all\nnine repos, so the \"changes no match\" claim in the commit is measured rather\nthan asserted.\n\nThe 13 PACKAGE_TYPE rows are exactly INV-karud's residual. They remain\ncorrect matches; what changed is that a reader can now see WHY from the\nrecord instead of re-running the matcher."  # a430
